<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3912/17  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.8344/49  German Marks</p>
<p>		     2.0651/56  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.5120/30  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     37.86/91   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     6.1776/51  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1788.2/1.2 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     118.28/38  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     8.0574/24  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.6564/84  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.9861/81  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6055/60</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$323.10/60</p>
</text>
